			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Based on the review and discussions referred to above, the Audit Committee recommended to the Board of Directors that the audited financial statements be included in the Company&#8217;s Annual Report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended November 30, 2025 for filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
