			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">For fiscal years 2025, 2024 and 2023, calculation of the average CAP for&#160;Non-PEO&#160;NEOs reflects the following adjustments made to the total compensation amounts reported for the applicable&#160;Non-PEO&#160;NEOs for those fiscal years, computed in accordance with Item 402(v) of Regulation&#160;S-K. The CAP dollar amounts included in the table do not reflect the actual amount of compensation earned by the executives or paid by us during the applicable year.&#160;The adjustments made to the SCT total for purposes of calculating CAP, in accordance with the relevant rules, are:</p>
