			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><i>Audit-Related Fees</i>&#160;would principally include fees incurred for due diligence in connection with potential transactions and accounting consultations. There were no audit-related fees incurred with EisnerAmper LLP in the fiscal years ended November 30, 2025 and 2024.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

